# SSD MoE ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** SSD-streaming MoE inference with a native C reader and OpenAI-compatible endpoints.

**LEONES status:** P1/P2 candidate; validation pending.

## Summary

SSD MoE explores direct expert streaming from SSD for models such as Qwen3.5-35B-A3B and Nemotron-H 30B-A3B.

## ODS fit

The project is relevant to storage-first MoE execution, especially where total expert weights exceed RAM or VRAM capacity.

The main integration questions are model-format compatibility, SSD bandwidth requirements, cache behaviour and serving stability.